ely  some states will still be counting votes  that arrive after election day  so let's be clear we probably can't  expect to have a winner straight away  and any hiccups could be used by both  presidential candidates to contest the  result  and they say they're ready for a fight  the only way they can take this  election away from us is if this is a  rigged election  he knows that on the legit it'd be hard  for him to win  so he wants to put obstacles of  participation but we do not  agonize we organize this year  more than ever americans are relying on  the u.s postal service to help  choose their next president but this  whole drama has created doubt  in a system many have trusted they need  it to work  because this election is expected to be  a close one  that was just one of a series of  explainers we've been working on to help  us  all understand the issues around the us  election so to keep up with  all our upcoming episodes i recommend  subscribing to al jazeera wherever  you're watching this video  i'll see you next week  [Music]  you
 

